@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ito-il27-nouns`
IMPORT `ito-il27-tax-years`
IMPORT `retirement-age-law`

-- ===========================================================================
-- Tests for the Retirement Age Law. Row IL-27. Expected values worked by hand from the Schedule (lines 187-192, 200-210) and ss 3, 6 (lines 42, 54, 55) before the
-- rules were run; none edited. Ages are in months (65 years = 780, 67 years = 804). A person born in calendar month b reaches the age in month b + age.
-- ===========================================================================

§ `Tests — the Retirement Age Law`

GIVEN `month` IS A NUMBER
      `year`  IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A person, for the Retirement Age Law`
`a man born in month` `month` `of` `year` MEANS
    `A person, for the Retirement Age Law` OF `a man`, `year`, `month`

GIVEN `month` IS A NUMBER
      `year`  IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A person, for the Retirement Age Law`
`a woman born in month` `month` `of` `year` MEANS
    `A person, for the Retirement Age Law` OF `a woman`, `year`, `month`

§§ `A man — Part A and section 3`

-- Part A: up to March 1939 65 years (780); April to August 1939 65 years 4 months (784); September 1939 to April 1940 65 and 8 (788); May to December 1940 66 (792);
-- January to August 1941 66 and 4 (796); September 1941 to April 1942 66 and 8 (800). Section 3: born after April 1942, 67 years (804). Each side of each boundary.
#ASSERT `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a man born in month` 3 `of` 1939) EQUALS 780
#ASSERT `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a man born in month` 1 `of` 1930) EQUALS 780
#ASSERT `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a man born in month` 4 `of` 1939) EQUALS 784
#ASSERT `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a man born in month` 8 `of` 1939) EQUALS 784
#ASSERT `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a man born in month` 9 `of` 1939) EQUALS 788
#ASSERT `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a man born in month` 4 `of` 1940) EQUALS 788
#ASSERT `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a man born in month` 5 `of` 1940) EQUALS 792
#ASSERT `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a man born in month` 12 `of` 1940) EQUALS 792
#ASSERT `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a man born in month` 1 `of` 1941) EQUALS 796
#ASSERT `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a man born in month` 8 `of` 1941) EQUALS 796
#ASSERT `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a man born in month` 9 `of` 1941) EQUALS 800
#ASSERT `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a man born in month` 4 `of` 1942) EQUALS 800
#ASSERT `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a man born in month` 5 `of` 1942) EQUALS 804
#ASSERT `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a man born in month` 6 `of` 1990) EQUALS 804

§§ `A woman — Part B and section 3`

-- Part B: May 1947 to December 1959 62 (744); 1960 62 and 4 (748); 1961 62 and 8 (752); 1962 63 (756); 1963 63 and 3 (759); 1964 63 and 6 (762); 1965 63 and 9 (765);
-- 1966 64 (768); 1967 64 and 3 (771); 1968 64 and 6 (774); 1969 64 and 9 (777). Section 3: born after December 1969, 65 years (780).
#ASSERT `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a woman born in month` 5 `of` 1947) EQUALS 744
#ASSERT `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a woman born in month` 12 `of` 1959) EQUALS 744
#ASSERT `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a woman born in month` 1 `of` 1960) EQUALS 748
#ASSERT `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a woman born in month` 12 `of` 1960) EQUALS 748
#ASSERT `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a woman born in month` 1 `of` 1961) EQUALS 752
#ASSERT `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a woman born in month` 12 `of` 1961) EQUALS 752
#ASSERT `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a woman born in month` 6 `of` 1962) EQUALS 756
#ASSERT `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a woman born in month` 6 `of` 1963) EQUALS 759
#ASSERT `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a woman born in month` 6 `of` 1964) EQUALS 762
#ASSERT `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a woman born in month` 6 `of` 1965) EQUALS 765
#ASSERT `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a woman born in month` 6 `of` 1966) EQUALS 768
#ASSERT `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a woman born in month` 6 `of` 1967) EQUALS 771
#ASSERT `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a woman born in month` 6 `of` 1968) EQUALS 774
#ASSERT `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a woman born in month` 1 `of` 1969) EQUALS 777
#ASSERT `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a woman born in month` 12 `of` 1969) EQUALS 777
#ASSERT `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a woman born in month` 1 `of` 1970) EQUALS 780
#ASSERT `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a woman born in month` 6 `of` 1990) EQUALS 780

§§ `The gap: a woman born before May 1947`

#ASSERT REFUSED `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a woman born in month` 4 `of` 1947) BECAUSE "Part B of the Schedule to the Retirement Age Law, as deposited, has no row for a woman born before May 1947"
#ASSERT REFUSED `the retirement age, in months, of` (`a woman born in month` 1 `of` 1940) BECAUSE "Part B of the Schedule to the Retirement Age Law, as deposited, has no row for a woman born before May 1947"
#ASSERT REFUSED `a person` (`a woman born in month` 4 `of` 1947) `has reached the retirement age in or before tax year` 2026 BECAUSE "Part B of the Schedule to the Retirement Age Law, as deposited, has no row for a woman born before May 1947"

§§ `The month in which the age is reached, and "reached in or before the tax year"`

-- A man born March 1939: 780 months after, March 2004. By the end of 2003: no. By the end of 2004: yes.
#ASSERT `a person` (`a man born in month` 3 `of` 1939) `has reached the retirement age in or before tax year` 2003 EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `a person` (`a man born in month` 3 `of` 1939) `has reached the retirement age in or before tax year` 2004 EQUALS TRUE
-- A man born April 1942: 66 and 8 (800 months): December 2008. A man born May 1942: 67 (804): May 2009.
#ASSERT `a person` (`a man born in month` 4 `of` 1942) `has reached the retirement age in or before tax year` 2007 EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `a person` (`a man born in month` 4 `of` 1942) `has reached the retirement age in or before tax year` 2008 EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `a person` (`a man born in month` 5 `of` 1942) `has reached the retirement age in or before tax year` 2008 EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `a person` (`a man born in month` 5 `of` 1942) `has reached the retirement age in or before tax year` 2009 EQUALS TRUE
-- A man born December 1959 reaches 67 in December 2026; born January 1960, in January 2027.
#ASSERT `a person` (`a man born in month` 12 `of` 1959) `has reached the retirement age in or before tax year` 2026 EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `a person` (`a man born in month` 1 `of` 1960) `has reached the retirement age in or before tax year` 2026 EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `a person` (`a man born in month` 1 `of` 1960) `has reached the retirement age in or before tax year` 2027 EQUALS TRUE
-- A woman born December 1969 (64 and 9) reaches it in September 2034; born January 1970 (65) in January 2035.
#ASSERT `a person` (`a woman born in month` 12 `of` 1969) `has reached the retirement age in or before tax year` 2034 EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `a person` (`a woman born in month` 12 `of` 1969) `has reached the retirement age in or before tax year` 2033 EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `a person` (`a woman born in month` 1 `of` 1970) `has reached the retirement age in or before tax year` 2034 EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `a person` (`a woman born in month` 1 `of` 1970) `has reached the retirement age in or before tax year` 2035 EQUALS TRUE
-- A woman born May 1947 (62): May 2009. A woman born January 1960 (62 and 4): May 2022.
#ASSERT `a person` (`a woman born in month` 5 `of` 1947) `has reached the retirement age in or before tax year` 2008 EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `a person` (`a woman born in month` 5 `of` 1947) `has reached the retirement age in or before tax year` 2009 EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `a person` (`a woman born in month` 1 `of` 1960) `has reached the retirement age in or before tax year` 2021 EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `a person` (`a woman born in month` 1 `of` 1960) `has reached the retirement age in or before tax year` 2022 EQUALS TRUE
-- The same woman and man in the same year differ: a man and a woman born June 1962: she reaches 63 in June 2025, he 67 in June 2029.
#ASSERT `a person` (`a woman born in month` 6 `of` 1962) `has reached the retirement age in or before tax year` 2025 EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `a person` (`a man born in month` 6 `of` 1962) `has reached the retirement age in or before tax year` 2025 EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `a person` (`a man born in month` 6 `of` 1962) `has reached the retirement age in or before tax year` 2029 EQUALS TRUE
